        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global ED-501-DU Dark Bronze Touch Bar Rim Exit Device</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Dark Bronze Exit Door Lock is for use on hollow metal or wood doors where there is no projection on the door face. A Grade 1 (Highest Grade) Touch Bar Rim Exit Device, sutiable for heavy duty commercial and industrial applications. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese exit door lock devices are <b>non-handed for doors 26\" to 36\" wide</b>. The latch and springs are made from long lasting high strength stainless steel. These exit door lock devices are listed by U.L./U.L.C. and comply with U.L. 10C and UBC 7-2 (1997) for positive pressure.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Global ED-501-DU Rim Exit Device:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Powder Coated Steel push bar, stainless steel springs</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Dark Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Latch: Stainless Steel, 3/4\" throw - 5/8\" deadlatch</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" Covers 161 prep, includes latch & strike filler plates</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Surface mounted for 5/8\" stop with shim</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile: 3\" minimum</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Reversible, non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" up to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Width: 36\", Field sizable to 26\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Height: Recommended installation at 41\" from finished floor to center line of push rail</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: Furnished with sheet metal and machine screws</li>\r\n<li>Dogging: 1/2\" of a turn 7/32\" hex key</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed: 51LT SA 13032</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant Door Hardware</a></li>\r\n<li>Grade 1</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 1 Year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Dark Bronze Exit Door Locks",
                "description": "Global ED-501-DU - This Dark Bronze Exit Door Lock is for use on hollow metal or wood doors where there is no projection on the door face. A Grade 1 (Highest Grade) Touch Bar Rim Exit Device, sutiable for heavy duty commercial and industrial applications, non-handed for doors 26 to 36 inches wide.",
                "keywords": "GLO-ED-501-DU Dark Bronze Exit Door Locks, Touch Bar Rim Exit Device, Global ED-501-DU global door controls push bar door exit device, door exit push bars, ED501 Commercial emergency exit devices, TACO ED-501-DU 36 Inch Wide Door Push Bar Exit Devices, 36  Inch Wide Door Touch Bar Rim Exit Devices,  Exit Devices, Exit door Devices, security panic devices, UL Listed 51LT SA 13032 exit door lock device,"
